  "body": "#343 introduced the phrasing \"the substring from _pointer_ in _input_\" to essentially check _c_ and the first one or two characters in _remaining_.\r\n\r\nI sort of raised this in a comment at the time, but I'm actually attempting to implement it now, and it's a little tedious, so I wanted to revisit: Is there a better way to phrase this, perhaps in a way that makes better use of the definitions in §1.2. Parsers?",
